        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:929fc6971c05537302d993ad",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我们在时间不充裕的状况下做到了万全准备。\n即便是首次挑战选拔赛也不用担心。她也完全能够驾驭沙土。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2cbcff74e57d0456a1b1743805b8f5d4c46fab32b56e22e5d6573bffd4220e0a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1078/storytimeline_041078004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        20,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/20/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d34b3afeff126414db18524",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "类似的安抚话语多得是，\n但她需要的应该不是这些才对。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4559ae916549f277be0f56bb372577b3e886661bb7d0066184ecf770f151aab1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1078/storytimeline_041078004.json",
      "json_path": [
