    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f75ce9d761edae675348106",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "现在的状态可能跑不出期望中的表现──像风一样的跑姿，\n或许这正是令她不安的元凶。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8cbea0056720497311ac8edbc2691a66f1687297bf5e65ea5b9f08be1c67a173",
